  "Question": "The precipitation amounts at a certain location for months 1 to 4 are 20, 35, 55, and 40 (mm), respectively. When these are plotted on a line graph, between which 2 adjacent months is the increase greatest?",
  "Choices": {
    "A": "Month 2 to month 3",
    "B": "Month 3 to month 4",
    "C": "Month 1 to month 2"
  },
  "Correct Answer": "A",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "The changes between adjacent months are: month 1 → month 2: +15; month 2 → month 3: +20; month 3 → month 4: -15. Therefore, the greatest increase is from month 2 to month 3, at 20 mm.",
